<translation id="5749154344207139683">Help us improve Private by taking this 1 minute survey.</translation>
<translation id="6954203250660846933">When you type in the address bar or search box, Browther sends what you type to your default search engine to get better suggestions. This is off in Private.</translation>
<translation id="3542179014707218534">Browther Private</translation>
<translation id="2076355018722231995">When browsing in Private mode, Browther will warn you before loading a site using an insecure connection</translation>
